VOICE_STEPS_ANDROID=Arabic Learn! reads words and readings aloud with this device’s text-to-speech, which has no Arabic voice yet. To add one:\n\n1. Tap Open settings below: it opens Text-to-speech output.\n2. As the preferred engine, choose Speech Services by Google.\n3. Tap the gear next to it, then Install voice data › Arabic, and download it.\n4. Come back to Arabic Learn!: the speaker buttons appear by themselves.
VOICE_STEPS_IOS=Arabic Learn! reads words and readings aloud with this device’s voices, and none of them speaks Arabic yet. To add one, open Settings › Accessibility › Spoken Content › Voices › Arabic and download a voice. Then come back to Arabic Learn!: the speaker buttons appear by themselves.
SPEECH_BETTER_VOICE=For a clearer voice, download a Arabic one in Settings › Accessibility › Spoken Content › Voices.
