CREDITS=Arabic’s stroke order drawn for Arabic Learn!. Words, their vowels, romanization and meanings from Wiktionary (CC BY-SA 4.0, via kaikki.org); how common they are from wordfreq (CC BY-SA 4.0); example sentences from Tatoeba (tatoeba.org, CC BY 2.0 FR). Handwriting recognition by Google ML Kit, which sends Google anonymous usage data while it is on. Every licence in full: Licences.
